All firms, companies, people, prices and contract numbers in this chapter are fictional. The example firm is SAMPLE ACCOUNTING FIRM, its issuing entity is SAMPLE ACCOUNTING FIRM PTE. LTD., and the example client is ABC PTE. LTD. (UEN 201900001A). Demo Manager is the department lead and the Director in charge; Demo Accountant is the tenant admin.
